rses.&nbsp;</p></div></div></span></div><div class="gf_hero-bg-wrap"><div class="gf_hero-bg"></div></div><div class="gf_hero-overlay" style="background:transparent;opacity:0.2"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667787656093" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667787656093" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667787656105" data-id="1667787656105"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667787728235" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667787728235" data-layout-lg="8+4" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="8+4" data-layout-sm="8+4" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-8 gf_col-md-8 gf_col-sm-8 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667787728305" data-id="1667787728305"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717591832694" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717591832694"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Founded by nationally renowned fitness   educator   James   Luscombe   in   2012,   Study   Active   have   continually innovated   and   evolved   the   way   that   Personal   Trainer   courses   are   delivered, setting the bar for a new era of fitness education.</p><p><br></p><p>In March 2024 Study Active acquired the Premier Global brand thus paving the way for&nbsp; anew era of quality in the fitness education sector.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Study Active’s approach to Fitness Education</strong></p><p><br></p><p>At   the   heart   of   everything   at   Study   Active   are   our   three   pillars;   quality, innovation   and   customer   service.   Our   philosophy   is   that   these   three   pillars should drive everything we do – so if you combine high quality education with  cutting  edge innovative resources and  unrivalled customer service  - then you have Study Active!</p><p><br></p><p><strong>The Study Active Mission Statement</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><i style="color: rgb(17, 64, 252);">“We aim to empower individuals to transform their careers to excel in the health & fitness sector.”</i></p><p><br></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-4 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1717602603014" data-id="1717602603014"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1718045177573" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1718045177573" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/5ff91772-ea9c-4b55-aa51-f0316487137d/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/Study_Active+Premier_Global_V4.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="60%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1853" height="1526" natural-width="1853" natural-height="1526"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1718045326206" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1718045326206"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="font-weight: bold;">The Study Active values</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: -0.1px;">- Quality</span></p><p>- Innovation</p><p>-&nbsp;<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: -0.1px;">Service</span></p><p>- Integrity</p><p>- Value</p></div></div></div></div><div class="element-wrap" 