text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>The Study Active team has  some of the UK’s  leading fitness educators, all of whom have considerable qualifications and experience within our sector. Study Active   are   pioneers   in   digital fitness   education   and   lead   the   way   with   our innovative approach to online & blended learning.</p><p><br></p><p>Our award-winning Online Personal Trainer course is amongst the most respected in the sector and will lead to all necessary accreditation to operate as a Personal Trainer both in the UK and internationally. All of our fitness education courses are awarded by Active IQ (the UK leading awarding body for fitness qualifications), endorsed by CIMSPA and regulated by Ofqual – we tick every box!&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Further our level 3 Nutrition carries Association for  Nutrition (AfN) certification whilst our Level 4 Nutrition course is awarded by the Royal Society of Public Health (RSPH)</p></div></div><div data-label="Icon List" data-key="icon-list" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1717592197947" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-iconlist" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1717592197947"><div class="module gf_module-left gf_module-left-lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs "><ul class="gf_icon-list"><li style="margin-bottom: 15px"><span class="gf-il-icon item-content" data-index="1" data-key="content" style="width: 45px"><div data-label="Icon" data-ver="2" id="e-1717592197947-1" class="element-wrap" data-id="1717592197947-1"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap"><svg fill="currentColor" height="100%" class="gf_icon" icon-class="bootstrap-outline-check" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.97 4.97a0.75 0.75 0 0 1 1.07 1.05l-3.99 4.99a0.75 0.75 0 0 1 -1.08 0.02L4.324 8