-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667787656105" data-id="1667787656105"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667788443567" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667788443567" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667787728305" data-id="1667787728305"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667788443561" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1667788443561"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Award-winning Fitness Education by Study Active</h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1718046590874" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1718046590874"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>To   showcase   our   high   levels   of   quality,   Study   Active   has   been   awarded “Enhancing”   status   by   CIMSPA   –   the   highest   possible   quality   accolade   that   a fitness education provider   can achieve. Further  in   2023   we won the ukactive Education Provider of the Year award as well as being finalist for Supplier of the  Year, Such accolades give our customers the comfort of knowing that we don’t just talk – we deliver!</p><p><br></p><p>Our impact to our customers does not stop when they achieve their qualification, more   so   the   next   journey   starts   at   this   point!   Through   our   long-standing partnership with The Gym Group, we can guarantee interviews in their 236 sites nationwide! If starting up on your own is more your goal, then our dedicated team will be happy to provide help and support to give you the launch pad you need to start your PT business!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="element-wrap" id="e-1717602854326" data-label="Separator" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-id="1717602854326"><div class="elm gf-elm-center" data-align="left"><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667789178404" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667789178404" data-extraclass="" data-row-gap="0px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667789178352" data-id="1667789178352"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667789192072" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667789192072"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667789192100" data-id="1667789192100"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667789227656" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1667789227656"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">What our Students Say About Study Active</h2></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667789220171" class="gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667789220171" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667789220200" data-id="1667789220200"><div data-label="Carousel" data-key="carousel" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1667789488582" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-carousel" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1667789488582"><div class="module main-slider owl-carousel owl-theme " data-collg="2" data-colmd="2" data-colsm="2" data-colxs="1" data-marginlg="30px" data-marginmd="24px" data-marginsm="16px" data-marginxs="5px" d